## EncountersApi

### List encounter conditions
## List encounter conditions
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/encounter-condition/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### Get encounter condition
## Get encounter condition
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/encounter-condition/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### List encounter condition values
## List encounter condition values
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/encounter-condition-value/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

### Get encounter condition value
## Get encounter condition value
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/encounter-condition-value/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic: {{username-password}}
Cookie: sessionid={{cookieKey}}

